    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2323340/extras/b5b01cf376e3b07e7f84f7224f2a79ce.avif?t=1752018265\" /></span><br>Bounce around pinball-esque worlds controlling <strong>Rockhound</strong>, an interdimensional punk who loves cool sunglasses! Collect valuable Gems around Grand Palace, a place filled with doors, secrets, and friends.<br>Discover a new action-adventure game with 3D cinematics, live footage, funky tunes, and stylized pixel art! All crafted with love by Jupitron!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2323340/extras/703a769c9f3d98147c5e0e1c9eedc350.poster.avif?t=1752018265\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2323340/extras/703a769c9f3d98147c5e0e1c9eedc350.webm?t=1752018265\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2323340/extras/703a769c9f3d98147c5e0e1c9eedc350.mp4?t=1752018265\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >There are 3 worlds in Power Solenoid, which include:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> 18 Levels with varying gravities, dangers, collectibles, and secrets (some of them feature friends with rewards)<br></li><li> 7 boss fights with unique patterns to uncover and master, divided into MiniBosses, BigBosses, and the epic Final Battle with [*********]<br></li><li> 6 Secret levels with increased difficulty!<br></li><li> 3 Special reward bonus levels (hidden)<br></li><li> A soundtrack with more than 40 mind-bending loop songs for every moment!</li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2323340/extras/660e2be16fe06c9425b2a293f4d74aa7.poster.avif?t=1752018265\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2323340/extras/660e2be16fe06c9425b2a293f4d74aa7.webm?t=1752018265\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2323340/extras/660e2be16fe06c9425b2a293f4d74aa7.mp4?t=1752018265\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A lot of Cosmic Items!</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Use your Astral Mirror to equip your new face, Cosmic Glasses, and Cosmic Tools!<br></li><li> 6 Cosmic Glasses that Rockhound can receive, buy, and discover throughout Grand Palace.<br></li><li> 3 Cosmic Tools that will aid Rockhound in navigating levels more easily and finding secret paths.</li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2323340/extras/a3740eaf9d50d129bffc512cfb61db4e.poster.avif?t=1752018265\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2323340/extras/a3740eaf9d50d129bffc512cfb61db4e.webm?t=1752018265\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2323340/extras/a3740eaf9d50d129bffc512cfb61db4e.mp4?t=1752018265\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Special stages and Minigames!</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Discover your amazing Starship called GlideHawk; use it to navigate classic-style shoot-em-up levels.<br></li><li> 2 friendly Goblins that will ask you for unusual Earthly items they're curious about.<br></li><li> Goblins that work in Grand Palace! Bankula runs an Exchange Gems business and Lion dreams of being a millionaire; you can help him achieve his dreams.<br></li><li> Rockhound can find minigames! Rockbowl is a Golden Coin farm that you can level up to obtain this strange, valuable earthly metal!<br></li><li> Besides Goblins, in Grand Palace, you can find Benny, a charming plasticine little dude who aspires to reach the heights of the universe! But he needs your help!</li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2323340/extras/2166e1655bbbab06e1dcb777505c46af.poster.avif?t=1752018265\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2323340/extras/2166e1655bbbab06e1dcb777505c46af.webm?t=1752018265\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2323340/extras/2166e1655bbbab06e1dcb777505c46af.mp4?t=1752018265\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Secrets and more secrets!</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Uncover the mysterious tomb of someone called Herman. Can you find the strange parts missing from the Tomb?<br></li><li> In Grand Palace, there are days! Goblins will sell different kinds of things each day; perhaps some days they're unavailable, who knows where they are?<br></li><li> Goblins will engage in a friendly competition called Smog, a reflex mind battle that will test your sight.<br></li><li> Goblins can evolve! Alter the appearance of a Goblin by strengthening your bond with them.<br></li><li> Goblins are collectors! They will sell you their valued items; these items will aid Rockhound in his journey.<br></li><li> Grand Palace isn\u2019t exempt from the system! Be cautious with your Cosmic Card expenses, a Credit Card from the outer dimensions!</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2323340/extras/c3f84f64518c1c2567c6725b58681767.poster.avif?t=1752018265\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2323340/extras/c3f84f64518c1c2567c6725b58681767.webm?t=1752018265\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=